er="100"><navLabel><text>A computing contract can change operators before it expires</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c9-a-computing-contract-can-change-operators-before-it-expires"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-101" playOrder="101"><navLabel><text>US authorizations enter the financing timetable</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c9-us-authorizations-enter-the-financing-timetable"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-102" playOrder="102"><navLabel><text>Trump holds commercial leverage whose records are being sought</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c9-trump-holds-commercial-leverage-whose-records-are-being-sought"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-103" playOrder="103"><navLabel><text>The Haas report brings SoftBank’s interests into the succession</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c9-the-haas-report-brings-softbanks-interests-into-the-succession"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-104" playOrder="104"><navLabel><text>Nvidia’s next leader inherits decisions that need financing</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c9-nvidias-next-leader-inherits-decisions-that-need-financing"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-105" playOrder="105"><navLabel><text>Sources</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c9-sources"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-106" playOrder="106"><navLabel><text>Limits</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml#c9-limits"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-107" playOrder="107"><navLabel><text>Nvidia: AI guarantees put the whole credit chain at stake</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch011.xhtml#chapter-10"/><navPoint id="nav-108" playOrder="108"><navLabel><text>Debt issuance accelerates with the data center buildout</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch011.xhtml#c10-debt-issuance-accelerates-with-the-data-center-buildout"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-109" playOrder="109"><navLabel><text>A guarantee can bring risk back to the supplier</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch011.xhtml#c10-a-guarantee-can-bring-risk-back-to-the-supplier"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-110" playOrder="110"><navLabel><text>Nscale commits to equipment while still arranging funding</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch011.xhtml#c10-nscale-commits-to-equipment-while-still-arranging-funding"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-111" playOrder="111"><navLabel><text>Nvidia’s billion-dollar commitment still has a closing date</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch011.xhtml#c10-nvidias-billion-dollar-commitment-still-has-a-closing-date"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-112" playOrder="112"><navLabel><text>The next CEO will decide how far future support should go</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch011.xhtml#c10-the-next-ceo-will-decide-how-far-future-support-should-go"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-113" playOrder="113"><navLabel><text>Washington has an industrial stake in the financing dependencies</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch011.xhtml#c10-washington-has-an-industrial-stake-in-the-financing-dependencies"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-114" playOrder="114"><navLabel><text>Sources</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch011.xhtml#c10-sources"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-115" playOrder="115"><navLabel><text>Limits</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch011.xhtml#c10-limits"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-116" playOrder="116"><navLabel><text>Nvidia: Huang’s assurances face an independent inquiry</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch012.xhtml#chapter-11"/><navPoint id="nav-117" playOrder="117"><navLabel><text>The board’s inquiry has its own mandate</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch012.xhtml#c11-the-boards-inquiry-has-its-own-mandate"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-118" playOrder="118"><navLabel><text>Congress seeks answers from the lawyer as well as the founder</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch012.xhtml#c11-congress-seeks-answers-from-the-lawyer-as-well-as-the-founder"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-119" playOrder="119"><navLabel><text>At Port Klang, an unsigned offer reaches its expiry date</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch012.xhtml#c11-at-port-klang-an-unsigned-offer-reaches-its-expiry-date"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-120" playOrder="120"><navLabel><text>A successor inherits contracts alongside the inquiry</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch012.xhtml#c11-a-successor-inherits-contracts-alongside-the-inquiry"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-121" playOrder="121"><navLabel><text>Washington’s influence will depend on identifiable decisions</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch012.xhtml#c11-washingtons-influence-will-depend-on-identifiable-decisions"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-122" playOrder="122"><navLabel><text>Sources</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch012.xhtml#c11-sources"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-123" playOrder="123"><navLabel><text>Limits</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch012.xhtml#c11-limits"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-124" playOrder="124"><navLabel><text>Nvidia after Huang: contracts, credit and the cost of the crisis</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#chapter-12"/><navPoint id="nav-125" playOrder="125"><navLabel><text>Musk raises supply concerns as Seoul stresses continuity</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#c12-musk-raises-supply-concerns-as-seoul-stresses-continuity"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-126" playOrder="126"><navLabel><text>Nvidia’s investment in Naver is complete</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#c12-nvidias-investment-in-naver-is-complete"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-127" playOrder="127"><navLabel><text>Nscale’s funding needs extend beyond the next billion</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#c12-nscales-funding-needs-extend-beyond-the-next-billion"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-128" playOrder="128"><navLabel><text>Credit elsewhere in the ecosystem provides a test of spillovers</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#c12-credit-elsewhere-in-the-ecosystem-provides-a-test-of-spillovers"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-129" playOrder="129"><navLabel><text>Shareholder lawsuits separate the company’s interests from its leaders’</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#c12-shareholder-lawsuits-separate-the-companys-interests-from-its-leaders"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-130" playOrder="130"><navLabel><text>The Pentagon already buys compute through Nvidia’s ecosystem</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#c12-the-pentagon-already-buys-compute-through-nvidias-ecosystem"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-131" playOrder="131"><navLabel><text>Export controls could reshape access to the platform</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#c12-export-controls-could-reshape-access-to-the-platform"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-132" playOrder="132"><navLabel><text>The board needs a clear view of its commitments</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#c12-the-board-needs-a-clear-view-of-its-commitments"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-133" playOrder="133"><navLabel><text>Sources</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#c12-sources"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-134" playOrder="134"><navLabel><text>Limits</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch013.xhtml#c12-limits"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-135" playOrder="135"><navLabel><text>AI financing enters the political arena</text></navLabel><content src="text/conclusion.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-136" playOrder="136"><navLabel><text>The language of credit, computing and control</text></navLabel><content src="text/glossary.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-137" playOrder="137"><navLabel><text>Sources for the introduction and conclusion</text></navLabel><content src="text/synthesis-sources.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-138" playOrder="138"><navLabel><text>List of infographics</text></navLabel><content src="text/figures.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-139" playOrder="139"><navLabel><text>Edition and credits</text></navLabel><content src="text/colophon.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="na